Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := तिजोरी नवीन: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault एन्क्रिप्ट: message किल्ली: key.
>> decrypted := vault डिक्रिप्ट: encrypted किल्ली: key.

आउटपुट 
लिहा: ['Message:'], नवी-ओळ
लिहा: message, नवी-ओळ
लिहा: ['Decrypted:'], नवी-ओळ
लिहा: decrypted, नवी-ओळ.
